@UPMS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Login (admin seed)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@upms.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Register a passenger
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@upms.local",
  "password": "Student@123",
  "fullName": "Demo Student"
}

### List routes (paste the token)
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List trips
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a route (Admin)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "JS-02",
  "name": "Campus to Kotri",
  "active": true
}
